  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国深秋哪里的秋色最浓？咱们走起来又最舒坦的吗？上回咱们盘点的中国十大最惊艳的深秋奇观。好多朋友留言说，王老师啊景是真美，可动不动就爬大山，咱们这膝盖实在遭不住，有没有平平坦坦，不废腿就能看大景的地方有，而且不止一个。今天咱们盘点的这六个地方，一个比一个懂，咱们一个比一个有看头。有一个地方，咱们一步山路不用走，坐在平平稳稳的大画房里，一抬头，满江几百米，绝壁上全是红火。还有一个地方连着十来里，全是大平路，脚底下铺着厚厚的碎金毯子，踩上去软乎乎的，连鞋底都搁不着。看到这儿觉得有点意思的朋友，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，再点个收藏，省得手一滑，咱们就错过了。嗯，第六名，北京房山坡峰岭，很多人只知道香山人挤人，却不知道，就在房山周口店的太行山脚下藏着一整座能走进去的大红山。这片山坡有多大。足足两千多亩里头扎扎实实长着二十多万株，黄雏树二十多万株，大树全在一座山上变红。你想那是多扎实的颜色？别处的红叶的翻山越岭，这儿是石板路，平平缓缓，两边全是黄区，红叶伸手就够得着。您想象一下，镜头从步道这头扫到那头，左边是红，右边是红，抬眼望过去，整面山坡都是大红色，您就陷在里头。风一过，叶子沙沙响，空气里一股清苦的树叶味。最佳时间是十月中下旬，到十一月初，去早了，叶子还泛黄，去晚了，一场风就熄了，不用爬险坡，就能把一整面红衫抱在怀里。您说这算不算秋天给北京人留的一扇家门口的窗？第五名，浙江长兴十里古银杏长廊湖州长兴县小浦镇八都渠从北方的红转到江南，换成了纯粹的金黄。这里有多少银杏，数万株连绵十来里，您琢磨一下，数万株银杏一起变黄是什么场面？这儿是平地，没有坡，要爬一条乡间路走下去，房前屋后都被金叶子遮满，小石桥上铺着碎金，脚下是厚厚的落叶，踩上去软软的风一吹，叶子打着圈儿落在肩膀上。最佳时间是十一月中下旬去早了，叶子还绿着去晚了，落得只剩一地黄平平的走，慢慢的看金子，就在您脚底下，腿脚不太利索的老人家也走的多。第四名，重庆巫山小三峡、八雾峡别处的秋天都在地面上，八雾峡的秋天全直挺挺立在江水两岸。这一回得换个看法，不在路上看，在船上看画坊稳稳的从碧绿的江水中间穿过去，两边是刀削一样的直立，崖壁近千米高，野蜂和黄裘就挂在崖壁上，红彤彤的一层一层往您头顶上压低头，翡翠绿的江水里又倒着一片红影，船桨划开水哗哗的响，江风带着凉气扑在脸上。最佳时间是十一月中旬到十二月初，去早了。红的不够，去晚的叶子都掉进水里，压上就空了。人在水上红在半空，这个角度别处给不了，您说这算不算？红叶？长到了天上，第三名，湖北随州千年银杏谷、随州市洛阳镇。这里的银杏不是一片树林，是三百多株上千年的老树。年纪最大的几颗至少从宋朝就站在这儿了。听过多少年的钟声，看过多少年的炊烟，树干的好几个人，手拉手才抱得过来。一棵树的树冠就是一顶金色的大伞，阳光从老枝杈的缝里漏下来，把整个村子照成了金子，落叶在地上积了几寸，深一脚踩进去，沙沙地响，脚腕子都陷在里头。最佳时间是十一月中旬前后，就那么十来天，长兴给您的是十里金路，这儿给您的是一棵树。撑起来的一整片天。第二名，环仁、枫林谷、辽宁本溪桓仁满族自治县长白山余脉深处，森林覆盖率高达百分之九十八的红峰秘境。这儿的红是关东大地上最浓、最霸道的一种。九角峰是一角峰，连绵好几万米，您上到平缓的卧龙顶，往下一看，整片山岭像被人盗了。一整桶红岩亮红色从脚边一直漫到天边，风一吹向海浪在翻滚。镜头从观景台一点点推出去，不是几颗树，红，是整个山谷都在烧，红到没有第二种颜色，林子里一股凉丝丝的树叶味，脚下的落叶咯吱咯吱响。最佳时间是十月上旬到中旬去早了。红的发浅，去晚了，叶子就薄了，这儿把单一的红推到了尽头，您说这算不算老天爷把颜料罐子打翻了？聊到这儿，我想跟您唠几句心里话，咱们前面讲的地方说到底是同一类风景大地的秋色，可我看评论区还是有人问地方是好地方，可到底什么时候去最好？这几处又散在天南地北一趟，怎么串？哪一段平哪一段得抬腿心里没底，还有带孙子孙女的，想给孩子讲讲这些地方，可自己也说不全。前阵子我翻到一本书，正好解决这个问题，叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，分成好几个大类，每个地方什么时候去最好看什么，怎么去都讲的清清楚楚。图印的透亮一页，一幅大画能去的地方出门前翻一翻，暂时去不了的，就在家慢慢看，摆在茶几上，孙辈来了，翻两页，长见识。老两口晚上翻翻商量，明年去哪书，就在左下角商品里感兴趣的老朋友点进去看看。好，咱们接着说。最后一处第一名云南香格里拉千壶山，迪庆香格里拉市小钟殿乡。他有个来头中国国家地理，评选中国十大秋色色。他排第八，全国排第八，您想想那都美成什么样？可今天他排第一，为什么前面五个地方都只是把红或者把黄做到了各自的极致？千壶山不一样。深秋时节，高山上的红叶和红冠丛被秋霜，打得像烈火在烧。紧挨着的另一边是成片的高山落叶松，惊得耀眼，像瀑布一样倾泻下来。左边万顷金黄，右边满山红火红，与金在同一片大地上面对面撞上了您。站在那高原的风冷冷烈烈吹吹，脸上就脚下松松和落叶叶上去去，软软又一抬眼，两种颜色在天地间交风，谁也压不住，谁就佳时。时间是十月中下旬，就那十来天，脚抬是了松针还绿去晚了一场霜雪鲸和红都收了千壶山排第一，靠的是两个字。撞色别处是一种颜色，做到极致，这儿是两种极致，正面碰上体谅和反差，把前面五个全压了下去。您说这样的深秋排第一，值不值？这一趟咱们又走完了六处。深秋，坡峰岭是家门口的一整面，红山长金是平地走过十里的碎金泰八雾峡，是刀削绝壁上的水上火海。随州是千岁老树撑起的金穹顶。枫林谷是万亩红海，翻滚，千湖山是红，与金在天地间，正面相撞深秋不等人。有些地方一年之美，十来年，有些树占了上千年，就等您来看一眼，趁这个天正舒服，趁还走得动，收拾一下，出去走一趟吧。这六个地方，您最想去哪一个？评论区告诉我，觉得这期有收获的就转给身边跟您一样，爱看大地奇观的人，想听更多山河风光。点个关注，咱们下期接着看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 3510,
      "text": "您知道中国深秋哪里的秋色最浓？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3830,
      "end_ms": 6330,
      "text": "咱们走起来又最舒坦的吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6990,
      "end_ms": 11350,
      "text": "上回咱们盘点的中国十大最惊艳的深秋奇观。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12010,
      "end_ms": 13390,
      "text": "好多朋友留言说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13810,
      "end_ms": 15670,
      "text": "王老师啊景是真美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00006",
      "start_ms": 16090,
      "end_ms": 17690,
      "text": "可动不动就爬大山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17890,
      "end_ms": 19610,
      "text": "咱们这膝盖实在遭不住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20210,
      "end_ms": 21830,
      "text": "有没有平平坦坦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21990,
      "end_ms": 24650,
      "text": "不废腿就能看大景的地方有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25090,
      "end_ms": 26190,
      "text": "而且不止一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26610,
      "end_ms": 28830,
      "text": "今天咱们盘点的这六个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00012",
      "start_ms": 28990,
      "end_ms": 30300,
      "text": "一个比一个懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30580,
      "end_ms": 32800,
      "text": "咱们一个比一个有看头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00014",
      "start_ms": 33060,
      "end_ms": 34000,
      "text": "有一个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34180,
      "end_ms": 35920,
      "text": "咱们一步山路不用走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36400,
      "end_ms": 38480,
      "text": "坐在平平稳稳的大画房里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38660,
      "end_ms": 39320,
      "text": "一抬头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39620,
      "end_ms": 40880,
      "text": "满江几百米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00019",
      "start_ms": 40980,
      "end_ms": 42380,
      "text": "绝壁上全是红火。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00020",
      "start_ms": 42740,
      "end_ms": 44420,
      "text": "还有一个地方连着十来里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00021",
      "start_ms": 44420,
      "end_ms": 45300,
      "text": "全是大平路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00022",
      "start_ms": 45620,
      "end_ms": 48160,
      "text": "脚底下铺着厚厚的碎金毯子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00023",
      "start_ms": 48540,
      "end_ms": 50140,
      "text": "踩上去软乎乎的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00024",
      "start_ms": 50280,
      "end_ms": 51580,
      "text": "连鞋底都搁不着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00025",
      "start_ms": 51940,
      "end_ms": 53820,
      "text": "看到这儿觉得有点意思的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00026",
      "start_ms": 54100,
      "end_ms": 55960,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00027",
      "start_ms": 56320,
      "end_ms": 57220,
      "text": "再点个收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00028",
      "start_ms": 57720,
      "end_ms": 58720,
      "text": "省得手一滑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00029",
      "start_ms": 59020,
      "end_ms": 60010,
      "text": "咱们就错过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00030",
      "start_ms": 60110,
      "end_ms": 60320,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00031",
      "start_ms": 60550,
      "end_ms": 61185,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00032",
      "start_ms": 61560,
      "end_ms": 63075,
      "text": "北京房山坡峰岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00033",
      "start_ms": 63390,
      "end_ms": 65555,
      "text": "很多人只知道香山人挤人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00034",
      "start_ms": 66140,
      "end_ms": 66820,
      "text": "却不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00035",
      "start_ms": 66820,
      "end_ms": 73015,
      "text": "就在房山周口店的太行山脚下藏着一整座能走进去的大红山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00036",
      "start_ms": 73860,
      "end_ms": 75415,
      "text": "这片山坡有多大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00037",
      "start_ms": 75820,
      "end_ms": 79980,
      "text": "足足两千多亩里头扎扎实实长着二十多万株，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00038",
      "start_ms": 80000,
      "end_ms": 82690,
      "text": "黄雏树二十多万株，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00039",
      "start_ms": 82710,
      "end_ms": 84985,
      "text": "大树全在一座山上变红。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00040",
      "start_ms": 85490,
      "end_ms": 87205,
      "text": "你想那是多扎实的颜色？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00041",
      "start_ms": 87640,
      "end_ms": 89545,
      "text": "别处的红叶的翻山越岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00042",
      "start_ms": 89810,
      "end_ms": 90690,
      "text": "这儿是石板路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00043",
      "start_ms": 90890,
      "end_ms": 91930,
      "text": "平平缓缓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00044",
      "start_ms": 92170,
      "end_ms": 93465,
      "text": "两边全是黄区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00045",
      "start_ms": 94200,
      "end_ms": 96105,
      "text": "红叶伸手就够得着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00046",
      "start_ms": 96510,
      "end_ms": 97575,
      "text": "您想象一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00047",
      "start_ms": 98010,
      "end_ms": 100575,
      "text": "镜头从步道这头扫到那头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00048",
      "start_ms": 101050,
      "end_ms": 101950,
      "text": "左边是红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00049",
      "start_ms": 102130,
      "end_ms": 103075,
      "text": "右边是红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00050",
      "start_ms": 103670,
      "end_ms": 104965,
      "text": "抬眼望过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00051",
      "start_ms": 105400,
      "end_ms": 107445,
      "text": "整面山坡都是大红色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00052",
      "start_ms": 107930,
      "end_ms": 109145,
      "text": "您就陷在里头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00053",
      "start_ms": 109570,
      "end_ms": 110245,
      "text": "风一过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00054",
      "start_ms": 110550,
      "end_ms": 111445,
      "text": "叶子沙沙响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00055",
      "start_ms": 111750,
      "end_ms": 114085,
      "text": "空气里一股清苦的树叶味。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00056",
      "start_ms": 114740,
      "end_ms": 117095,
      "text": "最佳时间是十月中下旬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00057",
      "start_ms": 117330,
      "end_ms": 118255,
      "text": "到十一月初，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00058",
      "start_ms": 118770,
      "end_ms": 119450,
      "text": "去早了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00059",
      "start_ms": 119450,
      "end_ms": 120405,
      "text": "叶子还泛黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00060",
      "start_ms": 120790,
      "end_ms": 121450,
      "text": "去晚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00061",
      "start_ms": 121470,
      "end_ms": 122725,
      "text": "一场风就熄了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00062",
      "start_ms": 123070,
      "end_ms": 124455,
      "text": "不用爬险坡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00063",
      "start_ms": 124810,
      "end_ms": 127575,
      "text": "就能把一整面红衫抱在怀里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00064",
      "start_ms": 128220,
      "end_ms": 133075,
      "text": "您说这算不算秋天给北京人留的一扇家门口的窗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00065",
      "start_ms": 133380,
      "end_ms": 134005,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00066",
      "start_ms": 134290,
      "end_ms": 141885,
      "text": "浙江长兴十里古银杏长廊湖州长兴县小浦镇八都渠从北方的红转到江南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00067",
      "start_ms": 142250,
      "end_ms": 144205,
      "text": "换成了纯粹的金黄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00068",
      "start_ms": 144660,
      "end_ms": 145815,
      "text": "这里有多少银杏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00069",
      "start_ms": 146180,
      "end_ms": 148275,
      "text": "数万株连绵十来里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00070",
      "start_ms": 148680,
      "end_ms": 149555,
      "text": "您琢磨一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00071",
      "start_ms": 150060,
      "end_ms": 153315,
      "text": "数万株银杏一起变黄是什么场面？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00072",
      "start_ms": 153720,
      "end_ms": 154720,
      "text": "这儿是平地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00073",
      "start_ms": 154960,
      "end_ms": 155660,
      "text": "没有坡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00074",
      "start_ms": 155860,
      "end_ms": 158705,
      "text": "要爬一条乡间路走下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00075",
      "start_ms": 159080,
      "end_ms": 161305,
      "text": "房前屋后都被金叶子遮满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00076",
      "start_ms": 161570,
      "end_ms": 163255,
      "text": "小石桥上铺着碎金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00077",
      "start_ms": 163620,
      "end_ms": 165195,
      "text": "脚下是厚厚的落叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00078",
      "start_ms": 165540,
      "end_ms": 167985,
      "text": "踩上去软软的风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00079",
      "start_ms": 168340,
      "end_ms": 170525,
      "text": "叶子打着圈儿落在肩膀上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00080",
      "start_ms": 171060,
      "end_ms": 174400,
      "text": "最佳时间是十一月中下旬去早了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00081",
      "start_ms": 174400,
      "end_ms": 176230,
      "text": "叶子还绿着去晚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00082",
      "start_ms": 176270,
      "end_ms": 179295,
      "text": "落得只剩一地黄平平的走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00083",
      "start_ms": 179600,
      "end_ms": 181390,
      "text": "慢慢的看金子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00084",
      "start_ms": 181590,
      "end_ms": 182765,
      "text": "就在您脚底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00085",
      "start_ms": 183190,
      "end_ms": 186165,
      "text": "腿脚不太利索的老人家也走的多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00086",
      "start_ms": 186530,
      "end_ms": 187170,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00087",
      "start_ms": 187390,
      "end_ms": 192575,
      "text": "重庆巫山小三峡、八雾峡别处的秋天都在地面上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00088",
      "start_ms": 192890,
      "end_ms": 196385,
      "text": "八雾峡的秋天全直挺挺立在江水两岸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00089",
      "start_ms": 196750,
      "end_ms": 198485,
      "text": "这一回得换个看法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00090",
      "start_ms": 198790,
      "end_ms": 199755,
      "text": "不在路上看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00091",
      "start_ms": 200020,
      "end_ms": 204715,
      "text": "在船上看画坊稳稳的从碧绿的江水中间穿过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00092",
      "start_ms": 205190,
      "end_ms": 207370,
      "text": "两边是刀削一样的直立，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00093",
      "start_ms": 207390,
      "end_ms": 209155,
      "text": "崖壁近千米高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00094",
      "start_ms": 209720,
      "end_ms": 212265,
      "text": "野蜂和黄裘就挂在崖壁上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00095",
      "start_ms": 212560,
      "end_ms": 216865,
      "text": "红彤彤的一层一层往您头顶上压低头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00096",
      "start_ms": 217250,
      "end_ms": 220335,
      "text": "翡翠绿的江水里又倒着一片红影，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00097",
      "start_ms": 220820,
      "end_ms": 223225,
      "text": "船桨划开水哗哗的响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00098",
      "start_ms": 223740,
      "end_ms": 226105,
      "text": "江风带着凉气扑在脸上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00099",
      "start_ms": 226500,
      "end_ms": 229055,
      "text": "最佳时间是十一月中旬到十二月初，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00100",
      "start_ms": 229470,
      "end_ms": 230050,
      "text": "去早了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00101",
      "start_ms": 230050,
      "end_ms": 230715,
      "text": "红的不够，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00102",
      "start_ms": 231000,
      "end_ms": 232895,
      "text": "去晚的叶子都掉进水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00103",
      "start_ms": 233150,
      "end_ms": 234025,
      "text": "压上就空了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00104",
      "start_ms": 234330,
      "end_ms": 236285,
      "text": "人在水上红在半空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00105",
      "start_ms": 236650,
      "end_ms": 238095,
      "text": "这个角度别处给不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00106",
      "start_ms": 238410,
      "end_ms": 239410,
      "text": "您说这算不算？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00107",
      "start_ms": 239430,
      "end_ms": 239870,
      "text": "红叶？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00108",
      "start_ms": 239950,
      "end_ms": 240985,
      "text": "长到了天上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00109",
      "start_ms": 241390,
      "end_ms": 242085,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00110",
      "start_ms": 242480,
      "end_ms": 246135,
      "text": "湖北随州千年银杏谷、随州市洛阳镇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00111",
      "start_ms": 246710,
      "end_ms": 249105,
      "text": "这里的银杏不是一片树林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00112",
      "start_ms": 249610,
      "end_ms": 252125,
      "text": "是三百多株上千年的老树。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00113",
      "start_ms": 252570,
      "end_ms": 256474,
      "text": "年纪最大的几颗至少从宋朝就站在这儿了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00114",
      "start_ms": 256740,
      "end_ms": 258335,
      "text": "听过多少年的钟声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00115",
      "start_ms": 258690,
      "end_ms": 260275,
      "text": "看过多少年的炊烟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00116",
      "start_ms": 260830,
      "end_ms": 262290,
      "text": "树干的好几个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00117",
      "start_ms": 262510,
      "end_ms": 264165,
      "text": "手拉手才抱得过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00118",
      "start_ms": 264650,
      "end_ms": 268175,
      "text": "一棵树的树冠就是一顶金色的大伞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00119",
      "start_ms": 268610,
      "end_ms": 270970,
      "text": "阳光从老枝杈的缝里漏下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00120",
      "start_ms": 271150,
      "end_ms": 273405,
      "text": "把整个村子照成了金子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00121",
      "start_ms": 274010,
      "end_ms": 275870,
      "text": "落叶在地上积了几寸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00122",
      "start_ms": 275930,
      "end_ms": 277665,
      "text": "深一脚踩进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00123",
      "start_ms": 278030,
      "end_ms": 278915,
      "text": "沙沙地响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00124",
      "start_ms": 279400,
      "end_ms": 281375,
      "text": "脚腕子都陷在里头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00125",
      "start_ms": 281810,
      "end_ms": 284405,
      "text": "最佳时间是十一月中旬前后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00126",
      "start_ms": 284700,
      "end_ms": 285575,
      "text": "就那么十来天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00127",
      "start_ms": 285940,
      "end_ms": 287725,
      "text": "长兴给您的是十里金路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00128",
      "start_ms": 288280,
      "end_ms": 290155,
      "text": "这儿给您的是一棵树。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00129",
      "start_ms": 290470,
      "end_ms": 292310,
      "text": "撑起来的一整片天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00130",
      "start_ms": 292630,
      "end_ms": 293210,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00131",
      "start_ms": 293510,
      "end_ms": 299670,
      "text": "环仁、枫林谷、辽宁本溪桓仁满族自治县长白山余脉深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00132",
      "start_ms": 299990,
      "end_ms": 303750,
      "text": "森林覆盖率高达百分之九十八的红峰秘境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00133",
      "start_ms": 304050,
      "end_ms": 309010,
      "text": "这儿的红是关东大地上最浓、最霸道的一种。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00134",
      "start_ms": 309350,
      "end_ms": 311290,
      "text": "九角峰是一角峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00135",
      "start_ms": 311790,
      "end_ms": 313090,
      "text": "连绵好几万米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00136",
      "start_ms": 313570,
      "end_ms": 315650,
      "text": "您上到平缓的卧龙顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00137",
      "start_ms": 315950,
      "end_ms": 316790,
      "text": "往下一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00138",
      "start_ms": 317170,
      "end_ms": 319190,
      "text": "整片山岭像被人盗了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00139",
      "start_ms": 319190,
      "end_ms": 323880,
      "text": "一整桶红岩亮红色从脚边一直漫到天边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00140",
      "start_ms": 324440,
      "end_ms": 326880,
      "text": "风一吹向海浪在翻滚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00141",
      "start_ms": 327220,
      "end_ms": 330060,
      "text": "镜头从观景台一点点推出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00142",
      "start_ms": 330240,
      "end_ms": 331300,
      "text": "不是几颗树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00143",
      "start_ms": 331300,
      "end_ms": 331540,
      "text": "红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00144",
      "start_ms": 331980,
      "end_ms": 333880,
      "text": "是整个山谷都在烧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00145",
      "start_ms": 334480,
      "end_ms": 336280,
      "text": "红到没有第二种颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00146",
      "start_ms": 336760,
      "end_ms": 339400,
      "text": "林子里一股凉丝丝的树叶味，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00147",
      "start_ms": 339640,
      "end_ms": 341780,
      "text": "脚下的落叶咯吱咯吱响。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00148",
      "start_ms": 342200,
      "end_ms": 345900,
      "text": "最佳时间是十月上旬到中旬去早了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00149",
      "start_ms": 345900,
      "end_ms": 346560,
      "text": "红的发浅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00150",
      "start_ms": 346780,
      "end_ms": 347300,
      "text": "去晚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00151",
      "start_ms": 347300,
      "end_ms": 348240,
      "text": "叶子就薄了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00152",
      "start_ms": 348760,
      "end_ms": 351095,
      "text": "这儿把单一的红推到了尽头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00153",
      "start_ms": 351450,
      "end_ms": 355555,
      "text": "您说这算不算老天爷把颜料罐子打翻了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00154",
      "start_ms": 355900,
      "end_ms": 356515,
      "text": "聊到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00155",
      "start_ms": 356710,
      "end_ms": 358535,
      "text": "我想跟您唠几句心里话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00156",
      "start_ms": 359100,
      "end_ms": 364485,
      "text": "咱们前面讲的地方说到底是同一类风景大地的秋色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00157",
      "start_ms": 365120,
      "end_ms": 369015,
      "text": "可我看评论区还是有人问地方是好地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00158",
      "start_ms": 369450,
      "end_ms": 371385,
      "text": "可到底什么时候去最好？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00159",
      "start_ms": 371810,
      "end_ms": 374850,
      "text": "这几处又散在天南地北一趟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00160",
      "start_ms": 374850,
      "end_ms": 375310,
      "text": "怎么串？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00161",
      "start_ms": 375570,
      "end_ms": 378805,
      "text": "哪一段平哪一段得抬腿心里没底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00162",
      "start_ms": 379260,
      "end_ms": 380875,
      "text": "还有带孙子孙女的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00163",
      "start_ms": 381180,
      "end_ms": 383080,
      "text": "想给孩子讲讲这些地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00164",
      "start_ms": 383220,
      "end_ms": 384865,
      "text": "可自己也说不全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00165",
      "start_ms": 385320,
      "end_ms": 386860,
      "text": "前阵子我翻到一本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00166",
      "start_ms": 387200,
      "end_ms": 388645,
      "text": "正好解决这个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00167",
      "start_ms": 388960,
      "end_ms": 392975,
      "text": "叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00168",
      "start_ms": 393270,
      "end_ms": 397085,
      "text": "他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00169",
      "start_ms": 397350,
      "end_ms": 398685,
      "text": "分成好几个大类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00170",
      "start_ms": 399100,
      "end_ms": 401840,
      "text": "每个地方什么时候去最好看什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00171",
      "start_ms": 401960,
      "end_ms": 404140,
      "text": "怎么去都讲的清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00172",
      "start_ms": 404320,
      "end_ms": 406510,
      "text": "图印的透亮一页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00173",
      "start_ms": 406510,
      "end_ms": 409915,
      "text": "一幅大画能去的地方出门前翻一翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00174",
      "start_ms": 410210,
      "end_ms": 411270,
      "text": "暂时去不了的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00175",
      "start_ms": 411270,
      "end_ms": 412330,
      "text": "就在家慢慢看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00176",
      "start_ms": 413130,
      "end_ms": 414250,
      "text": "摆在茶几上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00177",
      "start_ms": 414590,
      "end_ms": 415570,
      "text": "孙辈来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00178",
      "start_ms": 415670,
      "end_ms": 416310,
      "text": "翻两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00179",
      "start_ms": 416310,
      "end_ms": 417070,
      "text": "长见识。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00180",
      "start_ms": 417550,
      "end_ms": 419870,
      "text": "老两口晚上翻翻商量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00181",
      "start_ms": 419870,
      "end_ms": 421430,
      "text": "明年去哪书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00182",
      "start_ms": 421510,
      "end_ms": 426030,
      "text": "就在左下角商品里感兴趣的老朋友点进去看看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00183",
      "start_ms": 426390,
      "end_ms": 426630,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00184",
      "start_ms": 426870,
      "end_ms": 427690,
      "text": "咱们接着说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00185",
      "start_ms": 427690,
      "end_ms": 431730,
      "text": "最后一处第一名云南香格里拉千壶山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00186",
      "start_ms": 432150,
      "end_ms": 434890,
      "text": "迪庆香格里拉市小钟殿乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00187",
      "start_ms": 435610,
      "end_ms": 438330,
      "text": "他有个来头中国国家地理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00188",
      "start_ms": 438330,
      "end_ms": 440440,
      "text": "评选中国十大秋色色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00189",
      "start_ms": 440680,
      "end_ms": 441500,
      "text": "他排第八，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00190",
      "start_ms": 441860,
      "end_ms": 442940,
      "text": "全国排第八，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00191",
      "start_ms": 443120,
      "end_ms": 444740,
      "text": "您想想那都美成什么样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00192",
      "start_ms": 445120,
      "end_ms": 446960,
      "text": "可今天他排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00193",
      "start_ms": 447060,
      "end_ms": 453480,
      "text": "为什么前面五个地方都只是把红或者把黄做到了各自的极致？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00194",
      "start_ms": 454200,
      "end_ms": 455380,
      "text": "千壶山不一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00195",
      "start_ms": 455740,
      "end_ms": 456640,
      "text": "深秋时节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00196",
      "start_ms": 456900,
      "end_ms": 460300,
      "text": "高山上的红叶和红冠丛被秋霜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00197",
      "start_ms": 460500,
      "end_ms": 461840,
      "text": "打得像烈火在烧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00198",
      "start_ms": 462580,
      "end_ms": 466460,
      "text": "紧挨着的另一边是成片的高山落叶松，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00199",
      "start_ms": 467200,
      "end_ms": 468200,
      "text": "惊得耀眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00200",
      "start_ms": 468560,
      "end_ms": 470970,
      "text": "像瀑布一样倾泻下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00201",
      "start_ms": 471350,
      "end_ms": 473250,
      "text": "左边万顷金黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00202",
      "start_ms": 473610,
      "end_ms": 476010,
      "text": "右边满山红火红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00203",
      "start_ms": 476050,
      "end_ms": 480430,
      "text": "与金在同一片大地上面对面撞上了您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00204",
      "start_ms": 480510,
      "end_ms": 483690,
      "text": "站在那高原的风冷冷烈烈吹吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00205",
      "start_ms": 483690,
      "end_ms": 487750,
      "text": "脸上就脚下松松和落叶叶上去去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00206",
      "start_ms": 487950,
      "end_ms": 489730,
      "text": "软软又一抬眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00207",
      "start_ms": 489730,
      "end_ms": 492290,
      "text": "两种颜色在天地间交风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00208",
      "start_ms": 492290,
      "end_ms": 493730,
      "text": "谁也压不住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00209",
      "start_ms": 493730,
      "end_ms": 495490,
      "text": "谁就佳时。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00210",
      "start_ms": 495490,
      "end_ms": 497070,
      "text": "时间是十月中下旬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00211",
      "start_ms": 497810,
      "end_ms": 498750,
      "text": "就那十来天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00212",
      "start_ms": 498750,
      "end_ms": 507100,
      "text": "脚抬是了松针还绿去晚了一场霜雪鲸和红都收了千壶山排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00213",
      "start_ms": 507300,
      "end_ms": 508540,
      "text": "靠的是两个字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00214",
      "start_ms": 508860,
      "end_ms": 511300,
      "text": "撞色别处是一种颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00215",
      "start_ms": 511300,
      "end_ms": 512120,
      "text": "做到极致，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00216",
      "start_ms": 512300,
      "end_ms": 513700,
      "text": "这儿是两种极致，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00217",
      "start_ms": 513880,
      "end_ms": 515900,
      "text": "正面碰上体谅和反差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00218",
      "start_ms": 516160,
      "end_ms": 518180,
      "text": "把前面五个全压了下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00219",
      "start_ms": 518680,
      "end_ms": 521280,
      "text": "您说这样的深秋排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00220",
      "start_ms": 521520,
      "end_ms": 522120,
      "text": "值不值？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00221",
      "start_ms": 522480,
      "end_ms": 525140,
      "text": "这一趟咱们又走完了六处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00222",
      "start_ms": 525140,
      "end_ms": 525580,
      "text": "深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00223",
      "start_ms": 525980,
      "end_ms": 528460,
      "text": "坡峰岭是家门口的一整面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00224",
      "start_ms": 528500,
      "end_ms": 534350,
      "text": "红山长金是平地走过十里的碎金泰八雾峡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00225",
      "start_ms": 534510,
      "end_ms": 537110,
      "text": "是刀削绝壁上的水上火海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00226",
      "start_ms": 537670,
      "end_ms": 541070,
      "text": "随州是千岁老树撑起的金穹顶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00227",
      "start_ms": 541570,
      "end_ms": 543650,
      "text": "枫林谷是万亩红海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00228",
      "start_ms": 543910,
      "end_ms": 544430,
      "text": "翻滚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00229",
      "start_ms": 544830,
      "end_ms": 546050,
      "text": "千湖山是红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00230",
      "start_ms": 546050,
      "end_ms": 547710,
      "text": "与金在天地间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00231",
      "start_ms": 547710,
      "end_ms": 550010,
      "text": "正面相撞深秋不等人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00232",
      "start_ms": 550250,
      "end_ms": 551790,
      "text": "有些地方一年之美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00233",
      "start_ms": 551790,
      "end_ms": 552330,
      "text": "十来年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00234",
      "start_ms": 552750,
      "end_ms": 554610,
      "text": "有些树占了上千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00235",
      "start_ms": 555170,
      "end_ms": 556770,
      "text": "就等您来看一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00236",
      "start_ms": 557130,
      "end_ms": 558470,
      "text": "趁这个天正舒服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00237",
      "start_ms": 558830,
      "end_ms": 559850,
      "text": "趁还走得动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00238",
      "start_ms": 560240,
      "end_ms": 560940,
      "text": "收拾一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00239",
      "start_ms": 561180,
      "end_ms": 562380,
      "text": "出去走一趟吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00240",
      "start_ms": 562920,
      "end_ms": 563820,
      "text": "这六个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00241",
      "start_ms": 564040,
      "end_ms": 565840,
      "text": "您最想去哪一个？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00242",
      "start_ms": 565980,
      "end_ms": 567160,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00243",
      "start_ms": 567460,
      "end_ms": 570800,
      "text": "觉得这期有收获的就转给身边跟您一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00244",
      "start_ms": 570880,
      "end_ms": 572420,
      "text": "爱看大地奇观的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00245",
      "start_ms": 572740,
      "end_ms": 574320,
      "text": "想听更多山河风光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00246",
      "start_ms": 574540,
      "end_ms": 575220,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_eb6c6f0c8993fb48_s00247",
      "start_ms": 575420,
      "end_ms": 577435,
      "text": "咱们下期接着看。"
    }
  ],
